---
layout: base
title: Contact
description: 'Get in touch with Ghurab — sponsorship, commercial work, or press.'
permalink: /contact/index.html
---

{#-
  Contact (spec S7, roadmap Phase 7).

  The roadmap offered two options -- three separate paths, or one form with a
  "reason" field -- and recommended the single branching form as less build
  overhead. Taking that. It also means one endpoint to configure, one form to
  keep accessible, and one place spam handling can go wrong instead of three.

  The three audiences still get distinct framing above the form, because a
  general and a journalist arriving here are looking for different signals,
  even though they submit through the same control.
-#}

<div class="wrapper">
  <header class="region" style="--region-space-top: var(--space-xl-2xl); --region-space-bottom: var(--space-m)">
    <div class="flow">
      <h1 class="font-display">Contact</h1>
      <p class="hero-subline" style="margin-inline: 0">
        One form, three conversations. Tell us which one you're starting.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="region" aria-labelledby="routes-heading" style="--region-space-bottom: var(--space-m)">
    <h2 id="routes-heading" class="visually-hidden">Reasons to get in touch</h2>
    <div class="grid" data-layout="thirds">
      <div class="pillar flow">
        <h3 class="font-display">Sponsors</h3>
        <p>Backing the competition team — robotics, hackathons, CTFs — before this becomes a company.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar flow">
        <h3 class="font-display">Clients</h3>
        <p>Contract work in automation, robotics, or security. See <a href="/services/">Services</a> first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar flow">
        <h3 class="font-display">Press</h3>
        <p>Questions, interviews, and background on the team and its work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="region" aria-labelledby="contact-form-heading">
    <div class="sponsor-cta flow">
      <h2 id="contact-form-heading" class="font-display">Get in Touch</h2>

      {% set formId = "contact" %}
      {% set formSubject = "Ghurab — new contact enquiry" %}
      {% set reasonLabel = "Reason for contact" %}
      {% set reasonOptions = ["Sponsorship", "Client work", "Press", "Other"] %}
      {% set submitLabel = "Send Message" %}
      {% set showMessage = true %}
      {% include "partials/inquiry-form.njk" %}

      {#- Direct address as a fallback: some of the audience in spec S3 will
         not use a web form at all, and a form-only contact page reads as
         evasive to press. personal.email is still a placeholder -- see the
         placeholder list. #}
      {% if personal.email %}
        <p class="contact-direct">
          Prefer email? <a href="mailto:{{ personal.email }}">{{ personal.email }}</a>
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% css "local" %}
  {% include "css/home.css" %}
  {% include "css/services.css" %}
{% endcss %}
